164
00:39:32,355 --> 00:39:34,915
力任せ それでよかった
putting all my strength into it, and that was fine.

165
00:39:34,915 --> 00:39:37,835
泣いて 泣いて 泣いて なんて残った
Crying, crying, crying, what was left?

166
00:39:37,835 --> 00:39:40,585
使い捨ての ドラマじゃしたくないな
I don't want it to be a disposable drama.

167
00:39:40,585 --> 00:39:43,385
謙遜 興奮の
Modest, excited,

168
00:39:43,385 --> 00:39:46,055
センチメンタル公園
sentimental park,

169
00:39:46,055 --> 00:39:48,365
真っ白な煙に 吹かれながら
drifting in the white smoke,

170
00:39:48,365 --> 00:39:50,855
歌う
singing.

171
00:39:50,855 --> 00:39:53,445
救いもない ドマイこと
With no salvation, a clumsy thing—

172
00:39:53,445 --> 00:39:56,385
ねえねえ 一人だ 昨日のさみしさは
Hey hey, being alone, yesterday's loneliness

173
00:39:56,385 --> 00:39:58,645
Maybe Rainy day

174
00:39:58,645 --> 00:40:01,355
すべてを 脱ぎ捨ててゆく
Shedding everything away,

175
00:40:01,355 --> 00:40:04,965
星のように光るみたいに
shining like stars.

176
00:40:05,393 --> 00:40:06,493
だって僕 は 星だから
'Cause I am a star,

177
00:40:06,493 --> 00:40:07,333
stellar stellar

178
00:40:07,333 --> 00:40:08,653
きっと君は もう 気づいていた
I'm sure you had already noticed,

179
00:40:08,653 --> 00:40:10,353
ぼくの心の奥で描いた
drawn deep within my heart—

180
00:40:10,353 --> 00:40:11,993
それがこれから話す陳腐なモノローグさ
a cliché monologue I'll now tell you.

181
00:40:27,924 --> 00:40:29,624
ずっと言えない言葉があった
There was always a word I couldn't say,

182
00:40:30,974 --> 00:40:32,944
壊せない壁があったんだずっとさ
and an unbreakable wall that stood in my way.

183
00:40:34,524 --> 00:40:35,514
ふと香り立つ朝の匂いが
The scent of morning gently rising

184
00:40:36,194 --> 00:40:37,584
どうしようもなく憎らしくて
was so hopelessly hateful to me.

185
00:40:38,894 --> 00:40:41,204
部屋の隅で膝を抱えて震えていた
Hugging my knees, trembling in the corner of my room...

186
00:40:41,594 --> 00:40:42,574
太陽なんかいらないから
I don't need a sun,

187
00:40:43,064 --> 00:40:44,164
明けなまいでいて──
please, just don't let the dawn break.

188
00:40:44,804 --> 00:40:46,424
その手を伸ばして誰かに届くように
Reach out your hand so it touches someone,

189
00:40:46,914 --> 00:40:49,414
僕だって君と同じ特別なんかじゃないから
'cause I'm not special, just like you.

190
00:40:49,694 --> 00:40:51,094
そうさ僕は夜を歌うよ stellar stellar
That's right, I sing to the night, stellar stellar,

191
00:40:51,094 --> 00:40:53,504
ありったけの輝きで今宵音楽はずっとずっと止まない
with all the brilliance I have. Tonight, the music won't ever, ever stop.

192
00:40:55,224 --> 00:40:56,854
そうだ僕がずっとなりたかったのは
That's right, what I always wanted to be

193
00:40:57,494 --> 00:40:59,774
待ってるシンデレラじゃないさ
isn't some waiting Cinderella...

194
00:40:59,774 --> 00:41:02,364
迎えに行く王子様だ
I am the prince coming to greet her.

195
00:41:03,114 --> 00:41:04,374
だって僕は星だから
'Cause I am a star,

196
00:41:04,374 --> 00:41:05,784
なんてありふれた話なんだ
or so the common story goes.

197
00:41:06,244 --> 00:41:09,074
理想だけ書き連ねていたノートの隅に眠るほんのワンシーンだ──
Just a single scene sleeping in a notebook where I wrote down only ideals.

198
00:41:09,454 --> 00:41:10,644
きっとあの星も泣いてるんだ
I'm sure even that star is crying.

199
00:41:11,164 --> 00:41:13,484
明日なんか来ないままでいて──
Please, just stay without tomorrow ever coming.

200
00:41:13,994 --> 00:41:15,764
その手を伸ばして誰かに届くように
Reach out your hand so it touches someone.

201
00:41:29,331 --> 00:41:31,711
本当に大切なものは目に見えないみたいなんだ
The truly precious things seem invisible.

202
00:41:32,871 --> 00:41:34,791
そうさ僕は夜を歌うよ stellar stellar
That's right, I sing to the night, stellar stellar,

203
00:41:34,791 --> 00:41:37,571
ありのまま考えないで今宵音楽はきっときっと止まない
thinking as I am, tonight, the music surely won't, won't ever stop.

204
00:41:39,451 --> 00:41:40,971
そうだ僕がずっとなりたかったのは
That's right, what I always wanted to be

205
00:41:40,971 --> 00:41:43,381
あかぬけないヒロインじゃないさ
isn't a helpless heroine...

206
00:41:43,381 --> 00:41:45,971
救いに行くヒーローだ
I am the hero going to save her.

207
00:41:46,841 --> 00:41:48,931
夢見がちなオートギバナシ オートギバナシ
A dreamy fairytale, a fairytale.

208
00:41:49,161 --> 00:41:50,891
そうさ僕は夜を歌うよ stellar stellar
That's right, I sing to the night, stellar stellar,

209
00:41:50,891 --> 00:41:53,501
ありったけの輝きで今宵音楽はずっとずっと止まない
with all the brilliance I have. Tonight, the music won't ever, ever stop.

210
00:41:54,171 --> 00:41:56,271
そうさ僕は愛を歌うよ stellar stellar
That's right, I sing to love, stellar stellar,

211
00:41:56,271 --> 00:41:59,171
世界、宇宙の真ん中で今宵音楽はきっときっと止まない
right in the middle of the world and the universe. Tonight, the music won't, won't ever stop.

212
00:41:59,891 --> 00:42:01,761
そうだ僕がずっとなりたかったのは
That's right, what I always wanted to be

213
00:42:02,341 --> 00:42:04,951
待ってるシンデレラじゃないさ
isn't some waiting Cinderella...

214
00:42:04,951 --> 00:42:07,291
迎えに行く王子様だ
I am the prince coming to greet her.

215
00:42:08,001 --> 00:42:09,311
だって僕は星だから
'Cause I am a star,

216
00:42:09,551 --> 00:42:10,911
そうさ僕は星だった
that's right, I was a star.

217
00:42:10,911 --> 00:42:12,651
stellar stellar

218
00:42:29,643 --> 00:42:31,673
銀河越しの輝きじゃつまんない
Like a solitary star in the Milky Way,

219
00:42:32,593 --> 00:42:36,103
飛び出すの外なる果てつヘブン
flying out of this world straight to heaven.

220
00:42:36,103 --> 00:42:38,573
目を逸らすの見つめてたよね
You were watching me turn my eyes away, weren't you?

221
00:42:38,573 --> 00:42:40,973
You will align your ray

222
00:42:40,973 --> 00:42:43,423
踏み出した絶望の牢獄脱ぎ捨ててGet out and take
Dumping out all my sorrow, let's update it,

223
00:42:43,863 --> 00:42:46,423
希望の絶望を自分次第で
hoping to crush my helplessness.

224
00:42:46,423 --> 00:42:48,933
さあ次の幕開けをキズにしよう
Let's make it a destiny.

225
00:42:49,373 --> 00:42:51,513
Ah, 空に見上げた
Ah, I gazed at the sky,

226
00:42:51,513 --> 00:42:54,203
眩しすぎるだけじゃ物足りないから
far too bright and dazzling.

227
00:42:54,203 --> 00:42:57,093
偶然じゃない必然のNew senseでさ
It's not just a coincidence,

228
00:42:57,093 --> 00:42:59,843
ポースアップのシンパシーで
getting close with your sympathy.

229
00:42:59,843 --> 00:43:02,083
直感主義のイノセンスでさ
Intuitive, innocent desire,

230
00:43:02,083 --> 00:43:05,293
狭間の世界も自分次第でね
even this world belongs to me.

231
00:43:05,583 --> 00:43:07,993
初の囲い込みの呪いは
That's right, the menace of the beginning

232
00:43:07,993 --> 00:43:10,693
さあどうさ変化を恐れない覚悟さ
is something I don't even fear anymore,

233
00:43:10,693 --> 00:43:13,693
かき消して大地を抱けよいつの日のでりー
I want it to change.

234
00:43:13,693 --> 00:43:16,143
What do you need? What do you take?

235
00:43:16,143 --> 00:43:18,503
望むの場所は何処へ
Where is the place to go?

236
00:43:30,273 --> 00:43:31,713
銀河越しの輝きじゃ
Shining beyond the Milky Way,

237
00:43:31,713 --> 00:43:34,643
つまんない
it's just so boring.

238
00:43:34,643 --> 00:43:37,593
飛び出すの外なる果てツヘブン
Jumping out of this world straight to heaven,

239
00:43:37,593 --> 00:43:40,513
目を逸らすの見つめてたよね
you've been looking away, haven't you?

240
00:43:40,513 --> 00:43:43,423
You will align your ray

241
00:43:43,423 --> 00:43:46,423
踏み出した絶望の牢獄脱ぎ捨ててGet out and take
Dumping out all my sorrow, let's update it,

242
00:43:46,423 --> 00:43:49,423
希望の絶望を自分次第で
hoping to crush my helplessness.

243
00:43:49,423 --> 00:43:51,533
さあ次の幕開けをキズにしよう
